<title>AUSTRALIA: MOTORCYLING-WORLD SUPERBIKE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYLING-WORLD SUPERBIKE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results from the final</p>
<p>round of the world superbike championship on Phillip Island on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>First race</p>
<p>1. Anthony Gobert (Australia) Kawasaki 35 minutes 19.919</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Colin Edwards (U.S.) Yamaha		     35:20.203</p>
<p>3. Troy Corser (Australia) Ducati</p>
<p>4. Carl Fogarty (Britain) Honda</p>
<p>5. Peter Goddard (Australia) Suzuki</p>
<p>6. Wataru Yoshikawa (Japan) Yamaha</p>
<p>7. John Kocinski (U.S.) Ducati</p>
<p>8. Pier-Francesco Chili (Italy) Ducati</p>
<p>9. Mike Hale (U.S.) Ducati</p>
<p>10. Kirk McCarthy (Australia) Suzuki</p>
<p>Second race</p>
<p>1. Gobert						  35:24.149</p>
<p>2. Aaron Slight (New Zealand)			35:24.258</p>
<p>3. Edwards</p>
<p>4. Hale</p>
<p>5. Kocinski</p>
<p>6. Fogarty</p>
<p>7. Yoshikawa</p>
<p>8. Goddard</p>
<p>9. Chili</p>
